# Local development secrets (gitignored). Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in real
# development-only values. Never commit `.dev.vars`. Production uses
# `wrangler secret put` (set manually by a human, never automated).

# Telegram bot token from BotFather (Phase 2+). Required for the webhook reply path.
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=

# Webhook secret sent as X-Telegram-Bot-Api-Secret-Token (Phase 2+).
# Must match the secret_token registered via setWebhook.
# TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Master encryption key for AI provider credentials stored in D1 (Phase 4+).
# Generate locally with `openssl rand -hex 32`. Required for AI routing and for
# credential provisioning (scripts/provision.mjs reads it from
# HAWKTALK_CREDENTIAL_MASTER_SECRET or a hidden stdin prompt).
# CREDENTIAL_MASTER_SECRET=

# Numeric Telegram user ID of the instance owner (OWNER bootstrap, Phase 11+).
# When present, the matching Telegram user is assigned the OWNER role on upsert.
# OWNER_TELEGRAM_ID=